Generated art for shop.html drops here as PNG.

GROUND AND TEXTURE ONLY. Nothing in this folder may depict a carving.
Product imagery comes from pieces-data.js and from nowhere else — there
is deliberately no generated path for a piece to fall back onto.

  difference.png   1536x1024, macro of a raw amethyst cluster, read as
                   texture. No object, no bird, no base. The right third
                   is covered by a gradient in the page, so keep the
                   crystal detail left and centre.

A missing file hides its own element, leaving the gradient behind it.
